Description: GHSA-658j-r8rw-q6mx (CVE-2026-115560, the PHP security release of 19.11.2026): the session settings not to be changed at run time while session.upload_progress.enabled is on (an Error, as PHP 8.2 and later), the part of the fix Remi Collet's backport leaves out ("Default change only"; his commit of the default off and the reset in GINIT is upstream of this branch), with its test
Origin: php-src commit 3f70f66611583bca4ec18385f7f407e2808fa61f (Arnaud Le Blanc, 09.11.2026, PHP 8.2.36): its SESSION_CHECK_UPLOAD_PROGRESS_STATE and the INI handlers it guards; on the decision of aZ, 19.11.2026

